# Adaptive Omnitool: "You may reveal an artifact card from among them" and "put the rest on the bottom". On turn 3 the
# top six hold a Sol Ring and Bot1 takes nothing (Arrange with an empty hand group): the Sol Ring goes to the bottom
# with the rest, so the library keeps its size. On turn 5 the top six hold no artifact card: Bot1 still sees them, may
# take none (an Island for the hand is refused), and all six go to the bottom.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Adaptive Omnitool
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains
Plains
Island
Sol Ring
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
